<div class="tn-themes">
  <header class="tn-themes__head">
    <span class="tn-kicker">Ambientación</span>
    <h1>¿En qué ciudad llueve?</h1>
    <p>El fondo de la escena de portada y las tablas de creación aleatoria siguen a esta elección.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="tn-themes__grid">
    {{#each themes}}
      <button type="button" class="tn-theme {{#if active}}is-active{{/if}}" data-theme="{{id}}" style="background-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(8,9,11,.96) 6%, rgba(8,9,11,.35) 55%, rgba(8,9,11,.15)), url('{{scene.src}}');">
        <span class="tn-theme__body">
          <strong class="tn-theme__label">{{label}}</strong>
          <small class="tn-theme__blurb">{{blurb}}</small>
        </span>
        {{#if active}}<span class="tn-theme__flag">En uso</span>{{/if}}
      </button>
    {{/each}}
  </div>
</div>
